{
  "$schema": "../../../../packages/shared/schema/animation-scene.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "c-03-strategy",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Strategy: Algoritmayı Takılıp Çıkarılabilir Yapmak",
    "en": "Strategy: Making the Algorithm Pluggable"
  },
  "summary": {
    "tr": "ShippingCalculator bağlamı fiyatı seçili stratejiye hesaplatır; strateji çalışma zamanında ByWeight'ten Express'e değişir; bağlam kodu değişmez.",
    "en": "The ShippingCalculator context delegates pricing to the selected strategy; the strategy switches from ByWeight to Express at runtime; the context code does not change."
  },
  "a11y": {
    "description": {
      "tr": "Solda istemci, ortada ShippingCalculator bağlamı, sağda FlatRate, ByWeight ve Express strateji nesneleri. İstemci bağlama ByWeight stratejisini verir ve price çağırır; bağlam hesaplamayı ByWeight'e devreder. Sonra istemci Express'e geçer ve aynı price çağrısı Express'e gider.",
      "en": "Client on the left, the ShippingCalculator context in the middle, FlatRate, ByWeight and Express strategy objects on the right. The client gives the context the ByWeight strategy and calls price; the context delegates to ByWeight. Then the client switches to Express and the same price call goes to Express."
    }
  },
  "canvas": {
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 600
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "client",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "CheckoutPage",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 70,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "kullanıcı seçimi",
        "en": "user choice"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "ShippingCalculator",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 80,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "strategy: —",
        "en": "strategy: —"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flat",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "FlatRate",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 130,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 60,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "sabit 49 ₺",
        "en": "flat 49 ₺"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "weight",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "ByWeight",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 60,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "12 ₺/kg",
        "en": "12 ₺/kg"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "express",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "Express",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 470,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 60,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "ByWeight × 1,8",
        "en": "ByWeight × 1.8"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "c-ctx",
      "from": "client",
      "to": "ctx",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "price(parcel)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx-flat",
      "from": "ctx",
      "to": "flat",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "price()",
      "curvature": -0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx-weight",
      "from": "ctx",
      "to": "weight",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "price()"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx-express",
      "from": "ctx",
      "to": "express",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": "price()",
      "curvature": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "select",
      "title": {
        "tr": "1. Strateji dışarıdan seçilir",
        "en": "1. The strategy is chosen from outside"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Kullanıcı \"standart kargo\" seçer. CheckoutPage bağlama setStrategy(new ByWeight(12)) verir. Bağlam algoritmayı seçmez; yalnızca kullanır.",
        "en": "The user picks \"standard shipping\". CheckoutPage gives the context setStrategy(new ByWeight(12)). The context does not choose the algorithm; it only uses it."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "inherit": false,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "client",
          "ctx",
          "weight"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "c-ctx"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "ctx": {
          "status": "active",
          "sublabel": {
            "tr": "strategy: ByWeight",
            "en": "strategy: ByWeight"
          }
        },
        "weight": {
          "status": "active"
        },
        "flat": {
          "status": "muted"
        },
        "express": {
          "status": "muted"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "ctx-flat": {
          "status": "muted"
        },
        "ctx-express": {
          "status": "muted"
        }
      },
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "c-ctx",
          "shape": "diamond",
          "label": "setStrategy(ByWeight)",
          "durationMs": 900
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a1",
          "x": 450,
          "y": 170,
          "text": {
            "tr": "bağlamda if (type === ...) yok",
            "en": "no if (type === ...) in the context"
          },
          "target": "ctx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "delegate",
      "title": {
        "tr": "2. Bağlam devreder",
        "en": "2. The context delegates"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "price(parcel{3 kg}) çağrılır. Bağlam this.strategy.price(parcel) der; ByWeight 36 ₺ döner. Bağlam, vergi ve yuvarlama gibi ortak işleri kendi yapar; değişen kısım stratejidedir.",
        "en": "price(parcel{3 kg}) is called. The context says this.strategy.price(parcel); ByWeight returns 36 ₺. The context does shared work such as tax and rounding itself; the varying part lives in the strategy."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "weight"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "c-ctx",
          "ctx-weight"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "weight": {
          "status": "success",
          "badge": "36 ₺"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "c-ctx",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "price(3 kg)",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "ctx-weight",
          "startAt": 900,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "edge": "ctx-weight",
          "startAt": 1700,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "success",
          "label": "36 ₺",
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "edge": "c-ctx",
          "startAt": 2500,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "success",
          "label": "36 ₺",
          "durationMs": 700
        }
      ],
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "swap",
      "title": {
        "tr": "3. Çalışma zamanında değiştir",
        "en": "3. Swap at runtime"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Kullanıcı \"ekspres\" seçer. setStrategy(new Express(byWeight, 1.8)) ve aynı price çağrısı artık Express'e gider: 64,80 ₺. Bağlamın tek satırı değişmedi. Yeni bir fiyatlama (kampanya) eklemek = yeni sınıf.",
        "en": "The user picks \"express\". setStrategy(new Express(byWeight, 1.8)) and the same price call now goes to Express: 64.80 ₺. Not one line of the context changed. Adding a new pricing (campaign) = a new class."
      },
      "durationMs": 4000,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "express"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "ctx-express"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "ctx": {
          "sublabel": {
            "tr": "strategy: Express",
            "en": "strategy: Express"
          }
        },
        "weight": {
          "status": "idle",
          "badge": ""
        },
        "express": {
          "status": "success",
          "badge": "64,80 ₺"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {
        "ctx-weight": {
          "status": "idle"
        },
        "ctx-express": {
          "status": "active"
        }
      },
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "c-ctx",
          "shape": "diamond",
          "label": "setStrategy(Express)",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "c-ctx",
          "startAt": 900,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "price(3 kg)",
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "edge": "ctx-express",
          "startAt": 1700,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "edge": "ctx-express",
          "startAt": 2500,
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "success",
          "label": "64,80 ₺",
          "durationMs": 700
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a3",
          "x": 450,
          "y": 440,
          "text": {
            "tr": "TS/Python'da strateji çoğu zaman bir fonksiyondur",
            "en": "in TS/Python a strategy is often just a function"
          },
          "tone": "info",
          "target": "ctx"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "loop": false,
  "defaultSpeed": 1,
